218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Enterprises today face a critical challenge: unifying fragmented data environments to power analytics and AI initiatives without costly infrastructure overhauls. Strategy Mosaic introduces a Universal Intelligence Layer: a vendor-neutral, AI-powered platform that harmonizes data access, governance, and performance across all tools and clouds. Unlike siloed solutions, Mosaic offers complete visibility and centralized control, empowering secure, compliant oversight for both humans and AI. By delivering consistent business definitions, accelerating insight generation, and ensuring robust security, Mosaic empowers organizations to transform complex data ecosystems into a unified, high-performance foundation.)
/E (Enterprises today face a critical challenge: unifying fragmented data environments to power analytics and AI initiatives without costly infrastructure overhauls. Strategy Mosaic introduces a Universal Intelligence Layer: a vendor-neutral, AI-powered platform that harmonizes data access, governance, and performance across all tools and clouds. Unlike siloed solutions, Mosaic offers complete visibility and centralized control, empowering secure, compliant oversight for both humans and AI. By delivering consistent business definitions, accelerating insight generation, and ensuring robust security, Mosaic empowers organizations to transform complex data ecosystems into a unified, high-performance foundation.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
