279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The solution must provide comprehensive portability across multiple cloud environments, connectivity to a diverse array of data sources, and find insights through preferred BI tools. For example, a sales manager wants to include forecast data available in Salesforce alongside actual sales data from Snowflake in Power BI. This ability to connect, query, and join data across sources allows for flexible, comprehensive, and integrated reporting solutions without the need to centralize all your data into one dedicated source. By decoupling business semantics and security from the underlying data storage and consumption architecture, organizations can achieve seamless transitions between environments without incurring the high costs associated with re-architecting systems. This flexibility significantly accelerates organization-wide adoption and extends the value of both existing BI investments and the semantic layer itself.)
/E (The solution must provide comprehensive portability across multiple cloud environments, connectivity to a diverse array of data sources, and find insights through preferred BI tools. For example, a sales manager wants to include forecast data available in Salesforce alongside actual sales data from Snowflake in Power BI. This ability to connect, query, and join data across sources allows for flexible, comprehensive, and integrated reporting solutions without the need to centralize all your data into one dedicated source. By decoupling business semantics and security from the underlying data storage and consumption architecture, organizations can achieve seamless transitions between environments without incurring the high costs associated with re-architecting systems. This flexibility significantly accelerates organization-wide adoption and extends the value of both existing BI investments and the semantic layer itself.)
