/T (An effective solution must deliver semantically enriched, well-governed data that AI systems can readily consume and trust. It should automate modeling and semantic definition tasks while implementing robust protections that prevent sensitive information from being exposed to underlying large language models. By providing rich contextual metadata and consistent business definitions, the solution significantly improves AI accuracy and reliability, transforming generic AI into business-specific intelligence that understands your organization's unique data landscape. This foundation enables enterprises to deploy AI solutions that deliver accurate, compliant results across a wide range of AI initiatives.)
