/E (Business-friendly objects and definitions: The semantic layer provides consistent business definitions and metrics across various data sources. This allows business users to perform sophisticated analytics without needing to understand the complexity of the underlying data. It encapsulates critical measures like Revenue and Profit, supports non-aggregable measures like Inventory and Headcount, and includes sophisticated definitions for key business entities.)
